ned by 2+ points (analyst getting more cautious about new buying)) but the prior quarter was clean. One isolated quarter of softness isn't enough to act on — could just be the analyst tuning position size on a strong call. The trend layer flags it to monitor; if next quarter also comes in soft, the two-soft rule will kick in and we'll consider stepping the recommendation down.\"},{\"analysisId\":499,\"transcriptId\":390,\"callDate\":\"2021-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"Enphase (ENPH) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":65,\"symbol\":\"ENPH\",\"shortName\":\"Enphase Energy\",\"tickerStatus\":\"watchlist\",\"perCallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":45,\"tier\":\"speculative\",\"trajectory\":\"softening\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"This quarter showed a single soft signal (the gap between recommended size and fresh-money allocation widened by 2+ points (analyst getting more cautious about new buying)) but the prior quarter was clean. One isolated quarter of softness isn't enough to act on — could just be the analyst tuning position size on a strong call. The trend layer flags it to monitor; if next quarter also comes in soft, the two-soft rule will kick in and we'll consider stepping the recommendation down.\"},{\"analysisId\":416,\"transcriptId\":307,\"callDate\":\"2021-10-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"Alphabet (GOOG) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":106,\"symbol\":\"GOOGL\",\"shortName\":\"Alphabet\",\"tickerStatus\":\"watchlist\",\"perCallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":55,\"tier\":\"established\",\"trajectory\":\"improving\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"The analyst stepped conviction up this quarter (higher recommended size, fresh-money gap not widening, no credibility or mitigation concerns). On an established ticker we wait for a second confirming quarter before stepping the recommendation up — one strong quarter on a mature name can be noise. Watch this; if next quarter also comes in improving, the trend layer will upgrade.\"},{\"analysisId\":360,\"transcriptId\":251,\"callDate\":\"2021-10-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"AMD (AMD) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":111,\"symbol\":\"AMD\",\"shortName\":\"AMD\",\"tickerStatus\":\"watchlist\",\"perCallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":45,\"tier\":\"speculative\",\"trajectory\":\"improving\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"The analyst stepped conviction up this quarter (higher recommended size, fresh-money gap not widening, no credibility or mitigation concerns). On a speculative ticker (small-cap, volatile, or pre-revenue), waiting for a second confirming quarter often means missing the inflection — these names move fast. The trend layer steps the recommendation up one notch now (Hold → Add) rather than waiting.\"},{\"analysisId\":468,\"transcriptId\":359,\"callDate\":\"2021-10-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"QuantumScape (QS) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":51,\"symbol\":\"QS\",\"shortName\":\"QuantumScape\",\"tickerStatus\":\"watchlist\",\"perCallRec\":\"Hold\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Intact\",\"recommendedSize\":null,\"tier\":\"speculative\",\"trajectory\":\"flattening\",\"finalAction\":\"Hold\",\"trendRationale\":\"The thesis just stepped down from Strengthening to Intact, with none of the soft warning signs firing — typical of a growth name maturing into a steady-state cash generator. It's not deteriorating, but the upside is no longer compounding the way it was. The trend layer doesn't automatically act on this: the right call depends on whether there's a higher-conviction candidate to rotate into, which is a Layer 3 (opportunity scanner) decision we haven't built yet. Until then, treat this as a 'on deck for review' signal.\"},{\"analysisId\":785,\"transcriptId\":676,\"callDate\":\"2021-10-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"Facebook (FB) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcrip